transversalCurvePoints]]]]];\
\>", "Input"],

Cell["\<\
Show[Graphics3D[
 {{SurfaceColor[red, red, 2.1], EdgeForm[{Thickness[0.0001]}],
   Cases[Graphics3D[rePUpper], _Polygon, \[Infinity]]}, 
