      FormBox[
        RowBox[{"complex", 
          FormBox["z",
            "TraditionalForm"], "\[Hyphen]", "plane"}], TraditionalForm]]],
  ". The left graphic shows the ",
  "real part",
  " and the right graphic shows the ",
  "imaginary part",
  ". The steep vertical walls are caused by branch cuts of the individual \
summands."
}], "Text"]
}, Closed]]
}, Closed]],

