Cell["\<\
Clear[z, \[Alpha]]; \[CurlyEpsilon] = 10^(-6); 

FDeriv[\[Alpha]_, z_] :=  Sum[((-k)^(k - 1)/Gamma[1 + k - \[Alpha]])*z^(k - \
\[Alpha]),  {k, 1, 60}] \
\>", "Input"],

Cell["\<\
pp = 61;
ddata = Table[FDeriv[\[Alpha], z], {\[Alpha], -2, 5, 7/pp}, {z, -0.9 1/E, 0.9 \
1/E, 2 0.9 1/E/pp}];\
\>", "Input"],

